S621 CAULDRON BLOCK-TURN MINIMAX
================================
ADVERSARIAL BLOCK-TURN MINIMAX
------------------------------
Shared active cauldron pool; a placement that creates the relation removes that cauldron.
D chooses placements maximizing the final boil time; S chooses placements minimizing it.
The single-start schedule is D,S,S,D,D,...; no resonance-energy scalar is used.

